      "widgets_values": [
        "## B70 2K post (not official H3-2K)\n\nOSS H3-Base is 768p. Official 2K is hosted H3-Regenerate-2K, not in these weights.\n\nThis graph: RealESRGAN x4 tiled \u2192 lanczos 2560\u00d71440, keep H3 audio.\n\n- Unload the H3 UNet first (one job). `/free` if you just sampled.\n- Copy the mp4 into `input/` so LoadVideo sees it.\n- Sharper pixels, not new identity/physics detail.\n- Do not queue this while an H3 sample is running."
      ],
      "title": "B70 notes"
    }
